mages/taper.jpg\" alt=\"لو تيبر فيد\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/hot-towel-shave.jpg\" alt=\"حلاقة بالمنشفة الساخنة\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade.jpg\" alt=\"فيد جديد\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard.jpg\" alt=\"تهذيب اللحية وتحديدها\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"فرق جانبي مع فيد\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/kids-fade.jpg\" alt=\"فيد للأطفال\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/team.jpg\" alt=\"الحلاقون عند مدخل الصالون\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">التقييمات</p><h2>ماذا يقول عملاؤنا</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 176 تقييم</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">اقرأ المزيد من التقييمات على Google ←</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 1332 تقييم</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">اقرأ المزيد من التقييمات على Booksy ←</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Marty’s Barbershop delivers excellent service in a professional and welcoming environment. Marty is highly skilled, consistent and provides great hospitality. My Barber, Foofades is also outstanding, with great attention to detail and overall an amazing guy to talk to.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Best barber out in Vacaville, never disappointed me every time I came in🫡💯”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jaden · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/263621_martythebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I was literally walking out of my doctors appointment thinking about looking for a barber when I crossed paths with the owner. He brought me in and the vibes were amazing. Great people, amazing skills and overall amazing experience. It didn’t feel like going in to just get a cut. I got an experience.You gotta get a fresh cut from these guys.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Viv does an amazing job! She’s thorough, detail-oriented, and listens to her clients. Every haircut I’ve gotten from her is great and grows out well between cuts!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kendra · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/658054_hercuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Thank you, Hudson for making our first experience at this barbershop and with you great! It is evident you take pride in your craft and the results show for itself. We are very satisfied with our son’s haircut by you. I definitely recommend booking with him. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Jared always does a great job. Great attention to Detail and many years of experience. If you’re looking for a new barber,Jared is the guy. He’s been cutting my hair for over 10 years.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Bradley · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1694168_thatboy-reezy_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“He cut my haircut like how I imagined it. Takes his time and doesn’t rush. Cleanest skin mid fade in the area”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nish · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/966669_joe-big-money-lopez_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Carlos provided a great cut along with efficient timing, I would highly recommend his services!👌🏽”</blockquote><figcaption>— Emani · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593463_losblendzz_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“10/10 recommend this shop! Marty cuts my sons hair an always is quick, smooth and always makes my sons experience exceptional. If your not getting your hair cut here your missing out.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great haircut, Good convo &amp; Good vibes. Eli got me right. Thanks!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alex024 · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1244424_fadezbyeli-martysbarbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">الأسئلة الشائعة</p><h2>إجابات أسئلتكم</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>هل أحتاج إلى موعد؟</summary><p>يمكنك الحجز مع أي واحد منا عبر الإنترنت. أيام الأحد بموعد مسبق فقط، ونرحّب بالحضور بدون موعد خلال أيام الأسبوع ويوم السبت.</p></details><details><summary>كم سعر قصّة الشعر؟</summary><p>القصّة العادية من 40 إلى 50 دولارًا حسب الحلاق. راجع صفحة الحجز الخاصة بحلاقك لمعرفة الأسعار الحالية.</p></details><details><summary>هل لديكم خصم لكبار السن أو العسكريين؟</summary><p>نعم. عدد من حلاقينا يقدّمون قصّة كبار السن (65+) بـ 30 دولارًا، وقصّة العسكريين والمستجيبين الأوائل من 35 إلى 40 دولارًا.</p></details><details><summary>هل تقدّمون حلاقة بالمنشفة الساخنة؟</summary><p>بالتأكيد. Marty يقدّم الحلاقة التقليدية بـ 40 دولارًا، والقصّة مع الحلاقة التقليدية بالمنشفة الساخنة بـ 75 دولارًا. وViviana وJoe يقدّمان أيضًا الحلاقة التقليدية بالموس.</p></details><details><summary>هل تقبلون البطاقات؟</summary><p>نعم، نقبل البطاقات.</p></details><details><summary>هل يوجد Wi-Fi ومدخل لذوي الإعاقة؟</summary><p>نعم. لدينا Wi-Fi مجاني، والصالون مهيّأ للكراسي المتحركة.</p></details><details><summary>ما هي مواعيد العمل؟</summary><p>نفتح من الاثنين إلى الجمعة من 9 صباحًا حتى 6 مساءً، والسبت من 9 صباحًا حتى 3 عصرًا. أيام الأحد بموعد مسبق فقط.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">زورونا</p>\n      <h2>المواعيد والموقع</h2>\n      <address>2611 Nut Tree Rd Ste E<br>Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\">(707) 660-8108</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>الاثنين</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>الثلاثاء</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>الأربعاء</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>الخميس</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>الجمعة</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>السبت</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>الأحد</td><td>مغلق</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">أيام الأحد بموعد مسبق فقط.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/martysbarbershop_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@martysbarbershop_</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 8h14v10H5V10z\"/></svg><span>Booksy</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-